            {
                "entry_id": "d320feb6-8fae-344f-84c6-64e41a26b16a",
                "word": "notabilité",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "965e3d9d-454c-441e-a8f8-ffaa77e989f2",
                        "entry_id": "d320feb6-8fae-344f-84c6-64e41a26b16a",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "notabilités"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7b513a4b-e3f6-31f2-9955-f76c4ac0118c",
                        "entry_id": "d320feb6-8fae-344f-84c6-64e41a26b16a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Caractère de ce qui est notable."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2eac3828-fedf-435a-adbd-809897537554",
                                "sense_id": "7b513a4b-e3f6-31f2-9955-f76c4ac0118c",
                                "text": "Sa notabilité est incontestable."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fe0789db-f4c0-4f24-9113-22d1c2b804b5",
                                "sense_id": "7b513a4b-e3f6-31f2-9955-f76c4ac0118c",
                                "text": "Les codes de la supériorité sociale et de la notabilité, qui passent par l’élaboration de l’urbanité, ont donc un double usage, externe et interne."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "21c0c875-88eb-390a-ade5-beca82ae1afa",
                        "entry_id": "d320feb6-8fae-344f-84c6-64e41a26b16a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Personnage notable."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d0438f00-7601-41b3-af0f-dedecf53f9b8",
                                "sense_id": "21c0c875-88eb-390a-ade5-beca82ae1afa",
                                "text": "Trop souvent une aristocratie de notabilités locales a exploité à son profit les fonctions publiques, et fait sentir aux Anglais que son despotisme peut être plus intolérable encore que celui d’une administration centrale, […]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "30e9103d-0e3b-4a49-9632-93706e7d719c",
                                "sense_id": "21c0c875-88eb-390a-ade5-beca82ae1afa",
                                "text": "Une fois la victoire présidentielle acquise, le choix des candidats aux législatives sous l'étiquette de LREM s'est fait de manière centralisée sous l'égide d’un professionnel de la politique venu du gaullisme, Jean-Paul Delevoye, avec parfois l'intervention de notabilités socialistes ralliées à LREM [Lefebvre, 2019]."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a352f9c2-a238-4e25-92a7-e28c7e6b0b07",
                        "source_entry_id": "d320feb6-8fae-344f-84c6-64e41a26b16a",
                        "source_sense_description": "Caractère de ce qui est notable",
                        "target_lang_word": "notability",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "notability",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d084fc21-fcb1-3ad0-bf94-fa30975a3b99",
                                        "entry_id": "1b7a4a0f-1e56-3d29-86c1-5470b7239363",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality or state of being notable or eminent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d32cfa9b-b5fb-3ded-92b3-9a1f4f8c674c",
                                        "entry_id": "1b7a4a0f-1e56-3d29-86c1-5470b7239363",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A notable or eminent person or thing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a3f4e88-8630-4dd1-bddb-ff09de457be0",
                                                "sense_id": "d32cfa9b-b5fb-3ded-92b3-9a1f4f8c674c",
                                                "text": "Lesser notabilities have indeed utilized and built upon the opportunities created for filling in the gaps within the socioeconomic and political maps of the popular community."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3c4022f9-2214-30cb-acac-ec7b6746c6f5",
                                        "entry_id": "1b7a4a0f-1e56-3d29-86c1-5470b7239363",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Locally eminent people; the bourgeoisie or upper middle class"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "912e7c57-02c2-4e6e-8f8e-864b59a3fb22",
                                                "sense_id": "3c4022f9-2214-30cb-acac-ec7b6746c6f5",
                                                "text": "Just as the notability lived in its own social universe between the common citizenry and the aristocracy, so too did its intellectual universe express this complex mediation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca515fb7-f67f-4140-aa2f-f8f5557b4c19",
                                                "sense_id": "3c4022f9-2214-30cb-acac-ec7b6746c6f5",
                                                "text": "Such petitions were part of the role of the notability as understood at the time; a manifestation of their social hegemony was the obligation to speak for or represent the local community to the imperial center."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "34a25663-8993-3ce9-bc4d-2b82a1266839",
                                        "entry_id": "1b7a4a0f-1e56-3d29-86c1-5470b7239363",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A standard used to determine whether a subject merits its own article."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "534d4d9e-d6c9-45ed-b669-10645f214de7",
                        "source_entry_id": "d320feb6-8fae-344f-84c6-64e41a26b16a",
                        "source_sense_description": "Personne notable",
                        "target_lang_word": "Respektsperson",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Respektsperson",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a59917d0-a10d-3d42-944e-58cd46610dbb",
                                        "entry_id": "c14a9f64-2a67-39ff-9562-dd60df4d2ab6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Person, der mit Respekt begegnet wird"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70b6b5e2-6317-4ffe-8c8d-78fb25aad8cb",
                                                "sense_id": "a59917d0-a10d-3d42-944e-58cd46610dbb",
                                                "text": "„Die Eltern, der Gutsbesitzer und seine Frau, sind dagegen absolute Respektspersonen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc05b545-32c1-493a-a461-07c958964fc3",
                                                "sense_id": "a59917d0-a10d-3d42-944e-58cd46610dbb",
                                                "text": "„Der Lehrer oder noch häufiger die Lehrerin als Respektsperson stellt eine Frage, und der Schüler gibt eine verblüffende Antwort, die eine nonkonforme Antwort verrät.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e0870ece-a64d-4cca-9f64-0367a5ce32ea",
                                                "sense_id": "a59917d0-a10d-3d42-944e-58cd46610dbb",
                                                "text": "„Als sie ihre Silberhochzeit feierten, sprachen Respektspersonen viel von Moral, Treue und Beständigkeit, und alle Enkelkinder waren beeindruckt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "852f2ae4-70b1-4bf5-8cc2-789fa1c14f0a",
                                                "sense_id": "a59917d0-a10d-3d42-944e-58cd46610dbb",
                                                "text": "„Alles lachte laut, und auch am oberen Ende der Tafel, wo die Respektspersonen sassen, schien eine allgemeine Fröhlichkeit und munter angeregte Stimmung zu herrschen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
